Subject: Run Orchestrate workers in worktrees instead of cloud VMs
Kind: claudify

Upstream runs each Orchestrate worker on a cloud VM through
`environment: "cloud"`, unless it needs something only this machine
has. Claude Code's Agent tool has no `environment`, and its nearest
equivalent is `isolation: "worktree"`. A worktree is on this machine,
so the list of local-only needs goes, and only uncommitted state in
this checkout keeps a worker out of one, as in the swarm patch.

